'''Deadline''' is mob that spawns during the [[Great Spook (event)|Great Spook event]], after the death of a {{MobSprite|Primal Fear}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Deadline''' will walk slowly towards the player once spawned dealing {{Stat|dmg|1}}. They have {{Stat|hp|5}} and like [[Spooky Mobs]], take only {{Stat|Damage|1}} per hit. Upon reaching {{stat|hp|1}}, the player is required to stand immobile for 5 seconds before being able to hit '''Deadline''' again.

