== Bugs ==
*The player must move at least once after the '''Deadline''' spawns, otherwise the countdown will get stuck at 5 seconds. It  is also possible to move after {{Green|99}} [[mcw:ticks|ticks]] ({{Green|4.95s}}) and still complete the countdown.

